00:07:05.930 --> 00:07:10.190
So in 2012 the smallest number that

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:12.310
didn't appear was

00:07:12.310 --> 00:07:16.790
13,794 - doesn't appear

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:18.530
in the encyclopedia at all. Now I

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:20.300
went and checked if that was still true

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:22.760
and I'm afraid that it is no longer

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:24.290
still true, I think it's about four

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:27.000
sequences that that now appears in.

